  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">La ma&ntilde;ana de este domingo se ha celebrado en Onda la procesi&oacute;n del Encuentro, que ha tenido su momento m&aacute;s emotivo al saludar la Virgen de la Esperanza a la imagen de Jes&uacute;s resucitado en la Puerta del Sol. Con este acto se cierra el ciclo religioso cat&oacute;lico de la Semana Santa y la Pascua.</span></span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoencontreonda14/img_3997.jpg\" alt=\"img_3997\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoencontreonda14/img_3999.jpg\" alt=\"img_3999\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoencontreonda14/img_4000.jpg\" alt=\"img_4000\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoencontreonda14/img_4001.jpg\" alt=\"img_4001\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoencontreonda14/img_4003.jpg\" alt=\"img_4003\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoencontreonda14/img_4004.jpg\" alt=\"img_4004\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoencontreonda14/img_4005.jpg\" alt=\"img_4005\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoencontreonda14/img_4006.jpg\" alt=\"img_4006\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processoencontreonda14/img_4007.jpg\" alt=\"img_4007\" style=\"max